### Old version keeps working, but announces its end date (RFC 9745 Deprecation, RFC 8594 Sunset)
GET /v1/orders/ord_123
→ 200 OK
Deprecation: @1767225600
Sunset: Thu, 31 Dec 2026 23:59:59 GMT
Link: <https://api.example.com/docs/migrate-v2>; rel="deprecation"

### Non-breaking: add an optional field — old clients ignore it
{ "id": "ord_123", "status": "PAID", "currency": "INR" }

### Breaking (needs a new version): rename/remove a field, change a type or meaning,
### make an optional field required, change a status code or URL, tighten validation.
